      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788541599407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Aggregate news articles from thousands of source publishers all over the world via their public\nRSS feeds\n2. Users should be able to view a regional feed of news articles that we've aggregated\n3. Users should be able to scroll through the regional feed \"infinitely\" with consistent pagination",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Aggregate news articles from thousands of source publishers all over the world via their public\nRSS feeds\n2. Users should be able to view a regional feed of news articles that we've aggregated\n3. Users should be able to scroll through the regional feed \"infinitely\" with consistent pagination",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 94
    },
